		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Borrow Actions now, pay them back next turn.</em></p><p><strong>1/Safe Rest · Free Action.</strong> Regain all expended Actions. You lose an equal number of Actions on your next turn.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> You no longer lose any Actions.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> When Dying, your STR DC to use an Action is 8.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Elixir R gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Elixir R (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] The 1/Safe Rest use is a counter on this feature, tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: When Dying, your STR DC to use an Action is 8 (Nimble's dyingActionLimit rule changes the action count, not the DC).</em></p>",
